; WordCraft GUI screenshot run RUN. Results: RESULTS:RUN-*
FailAt 21
Protect RAM:wc/WordCraft +e
Protect RAM:wc/wordcraft-cli +e
Stack 4000000
SetEnv RUST_LOG debug
SetEnv WORDCRAFT_LOG RAM:wc/log-s.txt
Echo "RUN start" >RESULTS:RUN-start.txt
Date >RESULTS:RUN-date1.txt
RAM:wc/WordCraft --screenshot RAM:wc/shot1.png --screenshot-frames 8 RAM:wc/hello.docx
Echo $RC >RESULTS:RUN-shot.rc
Date >RESULTS:RUN-date2.txt
Copy RAM:wc/shot1.png RESULTS:RUN-shot1.png
Copy RAM:wc/log-s.txt RESULTS:RUN-log-s.txt
Echo "RUN shot done" >RESULTS:RUN-shot-done.txt
